#5400
The Entrance To The Exile's Rest~
   The narrow foyer of the Exile's Rest, the oldest inn of New Thalos. A
lamp burns in a niche by the door, as one burns by every door in the city,
and the boards are worn grey by boots. An iron stair spirals up to the
reception. From the south comes the noise of the common room, and the door
west opens onto Sultan's Walk.
