#5402
The Exile's Rest~
   The common room of the Exile's Rest. A great round bar fills the east
end, and behind it an old mage pours a row of cups at once without touching
the jug. On a low stage a singer gives the old songs of Thalos, the ones
about the white towers and the night they went dark, and the whole room
sings the refrains. Booths along the walls are packed with tired people. The
only way out is north.
~
