#5403
The Medina~
   The Medina is the widest road in New Thalos, and still it is too narrow.
Families who arrived with nothing camp along its edges under scraps of
canvas, and water-carriers shove through the crowd. A Flame-warden goes by
with a taper, lighting the street lamps early. The Common Square opens south
and the Medina runs on north.
