#5411
Outside The Southern Gate Of New Thalos~
   The road from the south ends here at the city's southern gate, between
two squat towers hung with the banner of Thalos: a tower and a rising sun.
Carts queue on the verge to be searched before they may enter, and the
guards on the wall watch the hills, not the carts. To the south the Supply
Road winds away through the hills; the gate leads north into the city.
